    "summary": "Astra single-pass visual source reading: all 70 prepared original pages in checkpoints 1–3. Restores five official T1 explanations, removes overlapping-window duplication and unrelated Exoplanets fragments, corrects transcription errors against originals, restores native sub-question solutions and AstroSat source order/figure. Source mistakes are retained and identified separately. No independent model checker.",
    "sourceGaps": [
      "Both archived English question editions print T12 AstroSat, but both 27-page English worked keys substitute T12 Exoplanets. No matching AstroSat solution was found in the inspected full year inventory.",
      "Summary Answer Sheets and Cover Sheet named by the instructions were not found in this archived source pack."
    ],
    "sourceDiscrepancies": [
      "Instructions specify 13 questions totalling 300 points; both question editions contain 12 questions totalling 250 points.",
      "Printed numerical/formula discrepancies are retained: T8 uses c/lambda_max for nu_max and prints 1233 pi then 3813; T9 numerical velocity denominator lacks a power of ten and the stated semimajor axis is 20933 km; T11.4 prints a direct rather than inverse mass ratio in the radius-cubed relation; T11.7 prose says 166.67 Hz while its mass calculation uses 142.86 Hz. No inferred corrections are substituted."
    ],
